  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Joint Programme to Build Urban and Rural Resilience in Syria (JP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The present UN Joint Programme (JP) has been developed to enable the participating UN organisations to respond to people&#x2019;s needs in Syria with the required early recovery and resilience programming that supports basic social services provision and livelihoods, while facilitating social cohesion and trying to address locally (some of) the causes of conflict. The Joint Programme brings the combined expertise and capacities of six UN agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
